<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Tobacco Coy 1996 profits higher.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Tobacco Coy 1996 profits higher.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result for Nigerian Tobacco Company to end-December 1996. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				   1996     1995</p>
<p> Gross sales		  2,200  vs 2,000</p>
<p> Profit before taxation    280.4 vs 172.9</p>
<p> Taxation			 28.3 vs  53.9</p>
<p> Profit after taxation	252  vs   119</p>
<p>NOTE - The company is not proposing any dividend for the year.</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
